+# 美国侧 AI 产业四层格局：芯片 → 云计算 → LLM → Agent 入口/运行时
+
+口径：本文按 2026-06-01 前后公开信息整理；优先使用公司公告、产品页、SEC 文件和官方博客，少量金额或占股采用权威媒体报道并在句内标注。大语言模型（large language model, LLM）、智能体（agent）、图形处理器（graphics processing unit, GPU）、专用集成电路（application-specific integrated circuit, ASIC）、张量处理单元（Tensor Processing Unit, TPU）和高带宽内存（high-bandwidth memory, HBM）首次出现时按中英并列处理。
+
+## 1. 四层覆盖矩阵
+
+| 厂商 | 芯片 | 云计算 | LLM | Agent 入口/运行时 |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Google / Alphabet | [Cloud TPU](https://cloud.google.com/tpu) | [Google Cloud](https://cloud.google.com/) | [Gemini](https://deepmind.google/models/gemini/) / [Google DeepMind](https://deepmind.google/) | [Jules](https://jules.google/) / [Vertex AI Agent Builder](https://cloud.google.com/products/agent-builder) |
+| Amazon / AWS | [AWS Trainium](https://aws.amazon.com/ai/machine-learning/trainium/) / [AWS Inferentia](https://aws.amazon.com/ai/machine-learning/inferentia/) | [AWS](https://aws.amazon.com/) | [Amazon Nova](https://aws.amazon.com/ai/generative-ai/nova/) | [Amazon Bedrock AgentCore](https://aws.amazon.com/bedrock/agentcore/) / [Amazon Bedrock Managed Agents powered by OpenAI](https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/04/bedrock-openai-models-codex-managed-agents/) |
+| Microsoft / GitHub | [Azure Maia](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/introducing-microsoft-azure-maia-ai-accelerator-and-azure-cobalt-cpu/) / [Maia 200](https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/01/26/maia-200-the-ai-accelerator-built-for-inference/) | [Microsoft Azure](https://azure.microsoft.com/) | [Phi](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/phi) / [Azure OpenAI Service](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/ai-services/openai-service) | [GitHub Copilot](https://github.com/features/copilot) / [Azure AI Foundry Agent Service](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/ai-agent-service) |
