+| Marvell | [Custom ASIC](https://www.marvell.com/products/custom-asic.html) / [accelerated infrastructure](https://www.marvell.com/content/dam/marvell/en/company/assets/marvell-accelerated-infrastructure-for-the-ai-era-event.pdf) | — | — | — |
+| OpenAI | — | — | [GPT models](https://platform.openai.com/docs/models) | [ChatGPT](https://chatgpt.com/) / [Codex](https://openai.com/index/introducing-codex/) |
+| Anthropic | — | — | [Claude](https://www.anthropic.com/claude) | [Claude Code](https://www.anthropic.com/product/claude-code) / [Claude Code on the web](https://www.claude.com/blog/claude-code-on-the-web) |
+| Meta | [MTIA](https://ai.meta.com/blog/meta-training-inference-accelerator-AI-MTIA/) | — | [Llama](https://www.llama.com/) | [Meta AI](https://www.meta.ai/) |
+| xAI | — | — | [Grok](https://x.ai/grok) | [Grok](https://grok.com/) |
